    "text": "By Get More Sports ,\n21 hours ago EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. — The New York Giants installed nearly 300 plays in training camp, offensive lineman Jon Runyan said, after offensive coordinator Matt Nagy earlier noted the team had only installed about half its plays several weeks into camp. Nagy added the system was designed to support multiple styles so personnel changes would not force a complete overhaul. Read full article",
